# Real founding on the #107 camp (canvas horseshoe, cooking fire, dedicated 48-unit stockpile),
# real rung-1 rite-ground completion, six really enrolled residents and one really dedicated
# 400-dram reservoir. The camp store is then filled to its declared capacity with real material
# objects: exactly the authored rung-2 bill (24 stone, 1 timber) plus 23 brush the bill does not
# ask for. Everything after setup is the REAL settlement pass on the turns this script's own
# `advance` spends -- the seam never calls KingdomUpgrade.Begin, KingdomPlots.Advance or
# KingdomArchitectureStamper.TryApplyUpgrade. Synthetic setup only: the camp, the residents, the
# reservoir, its drams, the synthetic KingdomBorn provenance and name each fixture body carries so
# production's roster gate admits it (citizenship and roster authority still come from production
# APIs; this is not a real arrival), the minted store units, and the pre-marked improvement notice,
# all disclosed in every report line. Not ordinary play, not a rendered Charter, no save/load or
# general camp acceptance. Covers PR #107 native case 2 only; cases 1, 3, 4, 5 and 6 remain owed.
DESCRIPTION=the camp heart's dedicated store keeps its identity, cell and unspent contents across a real paid waterstone upgrade paid out of that same store
REQUEST=founding-first-city
START=8.22@40,12
SCRIPT=stagedigest;camp-heart-setup;advance 600;camp-heart-check;advance 2400;camp-heart-check;stagedigest
VERBS=camp-heart-setup,camp-heart-check
EXPECT=stagedigest:OK~founded=false,camp-heart-setup:OK~native-camp-heart phase=1,advance:OK,camp-heart-check:OK~native-camp-heart phase=2,advance:OK,camp-heart-check:OK~native-camp-heart cases=1 passed=1 failed=0,stagedigest:OK~founded=true,COMPLETE
LOG_EXPECT=["MODWARN [Pets of Harvest Dawn] - Mod defining manual load order, please convert it to use the Dependencies field.","MODWARN [Pets of Harvest Dawn] - XmlDataHelper:: <...>/steamapps/common/Caves of Qud/CoQ_Data/StreamingAssets/DLC/PetsPack1/Freehold_Pet_Ercolano/PopulationTables.xml line 4 char 6"]
SET=camp,native-regression,test-only
TIMEOUT=1800
